ESSING INDUSTRIES \n(SMT. HARSIMRAT KAUR BADAL) \n  \n(a) to (d):  A Statement is laid on the Table of the House. \n  \n  \n  \n \n  \n\n  \nSTATEMENT REFERRED TO  IN REPLY TO PART (a) TO (d) OF  LOK \nSABHA STARRED QUESTION NO. *434  FOR ANSWER ED ON 23 RD JULY, 2019 \nREGARDING NEW FOOD PROCESSING CENTRES \n  \n(a): A total 2,651 number of additional registered food processing units/factories have been \nestablished during 2014 -15 to 2016 -17 over 2013 -14 as per the latest information available \nunder Annual Survey of Industries, 2016-17.  \n  \n(b):      As per the latest Annual Survey of Industries, 2016-17 there are 39,748 registered food \nprocessing units/factories in the country. As per 73rd round of NSSO, 2015 -16, there are \n24,59,929 number of unincorporated enterprises in the unorganized segment of food processing \nsector in the country. The State / UT-wise number of such registered and un-incorporated food \nprocessing units/factories/enterprises is at Annexure. \n  \n(c) & (d): The Ministry of Food Processing Industries does not set up any food processing \nindustries/ units/projects on its own. Under various schemes of Pradhan Mantri Kisan Sampada \nYojana (PMKSY) financial assistance is provided as capital subsidy in the  form of grants-in-\naid to the individuals, farmers, Farmer Producer Organisations (FPOs), Entrepreneurs, \nCooperatives, Societies, Self Help Groups (SHGs), Private Companies and Central/ State PSUs \netc. for setting up of food processing industries/ units/ p rojects anywhere in the country \nincluding in Punjab, Chandigarh and North-eastern States.  \n \n \n***** \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\nANNEXURE \n \nANNEXURE REFERRED TO IN REPLY TO PART (b) OF LOK SABHA STARRED \nQUESTION NO. *434 FOR ANSWER ED ON 23 RD JULY, 2019 REGARDING NEW \nFOOD PROCESSING CENTRES \n \nState/UT-wise list of Registered/Unincorporated Food Processing \nunits/factories/Enterprises \n  \nSl.  \nNo.  \nName of the   States/UTs Number   of \nRegistered 