ls of locations identified for opening of PSKs in \nKerala?\n \n \nANSWER\n \nTHE MINISTER OF STATE \nIN THE MINISTRY OF\n \nEXTERNAL AFFAIRS\n \n[SHRI V. MURALEEDHARAN]\n \n \n(\na)\n \n& (b) \nThe \nnumber of\n \noperational Passport Seva Kendras (PSK)\n \nand Post Office Passport Seva Kendras (POPSK)\n \nin the country \nduring 2016, 2017, 2018 and \nupto 31 \nMa\ny\n,\n \n2019 \nis\n \nat \nAnnexure\n-\nI\n.\n \nT\nhe \nnumber of \npassport and passport related applications received\n \nin \nthe corresponding years \nis\n \nat \nAnnexure\n-\nII\n.\n \n \n(c)\n \n& (d) \nAs on \n31\n \nMay\n, 201\n9, 505 Passport Seva Kendras\n \nare \noperational in the country\n. The list is at \nAnnexure\n-\nIII\n. \nIt\n \nincludes 43 \nin Maharashtra and 19 in \nKerala. S\nix\n \nmore POPSK \nare to be opened\n \nin Maharashtra\n \nat Alibagh, Bhiwandi, Dombivali, Mumbai North \nCentral, Nandurbar and Panvel in near future\n.\n \nIn respect of Kerala, \nall the \nPSK\n \nhave been made operational.\n \nThe opening of Passport \nSeva Kendras (PSK) in the country, including in Maharashtra and \nKerala, is an on\n-\ngoing activity and depends on various factors, \nincluding distance from the existing Passport Seva Kendras.\n \n \n***\n \n\n2\n \n \nAnnexure\n-\nI\n \nState Name\n \n2016\n \n2017\n \n2018\n \n2019 (till 31\n-\nMay\n-\n2019)\n \nOperati\nonal \nPSK\n \nOperatio\nnal \nPOPSK\n \nOperatio\nnal PSK\n \nOperationa\nl POPSK\n \nOperation\nal PSK\n \nOperati\nonal \nPOPSK\n \nOperatio\nnal PSK\n \nOperati\nonal \nPOPSK \n \nAndhra \nPradesh\n \n4\n \n-\n \n4\n \n3\n \n4\n \n19\n \n4\n \n20\n \nArunachal \nPradesh\n \n1\n \n-\n \n1\n \n-\n \n1\n \n2\n \n1\n \n2\n \nAssam\n \n1\n \n-\n \n1\n \n1\n \n1\n \n12\n \n1\n \n15\n \nBihar\n \n2\n \n-\n \n2\n \n5\n \n2\n \n16\n \n2\n \n30\n \nChandigarh\n \n1\n \n-\n \n1\n \n-\n \n1\n \n-\n \n1\n \n-\n \nChhattisgarh\n \n1\n \n-\n \n1\n \n1\n \n1\n \n5\n \n1\n \n7\n \nDadra and \nNagar Haveli\n \n-\n \n-\n \n-\n \n1\n \n-\n \n1\n